- b27: the missing section 6 is in the English and the Korean outlines.
- a16 / b12: zero-width spaces are in the Korean source at the same counts. They are not an Arabic-only defect the checker will allow to be deleted.
- a5 suggested wording «الاسم الصيني»: الصيني contains الصين, and the nationality check fails on block[16] because that Korean block does not name China. Wording used instead: اسم الشركة المكتوب بـ (漢字), with the gloss carrying the script.
